ef=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-11-eightythousand-減速應始於現在-超級智能兩三年內到來/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://img.transistorcdn.com/j97PjPaGGcsY3e3aSSSrEMR3FwxNMNm_Jhy6icyJksE/rs:fill:0:0:1/w:1400/h:1400/q:60/mb:500000/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWct/dXBsb2FkLXByb2R1/Y3Rpb24udHJhbnNp/c3Rvci5mbS83MGIw/YWNlMmY2NGY3ZTQ5/ZTliMjY1MDcxZDgz/NTQ4My5qcGc.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">2:02:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0811</span></div>\n<h2>減速窗口已錯過，超級智能兩三年內到來</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英國前 AI 安全負責人 Geoffrey Irving 認為，全面超級智能將在兩三年內到來，減速的窗口已經錯過；對齊的希望在於可擴展監督、人格研究和理論突破，而不是精確指定效用函數。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 對齊</span><span class=\"tag\">超級智能</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\"\n data-hay=\"別擋在孩子和屏幕之間，要站在孩子這邊 毒性應激的真實機制是被暴露時缺少成人緩衝；越能和孩子站同一邊、把技術當共同對手，關係就越能成為數字時代最強的保護。 Ask Lisa: The Psychology of Raising Tweens &amp; Teens Ask Lisa 284: ENCORE: Screens, Toxic Stress &amp; Staying Connected with Dr. Nadine Burke Harris 屏幕時間 毒性應激 ACEs 青春期 AI 陪伴 親子關係 ACEs toxic stress response buffering caregiving upstander\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-11-asklisa-別站在孩子和屏幕之間-要站在孩子這邊/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://megaphone.imgix.net/podcasts/c55e4104-cbbe-11ec-93d2-ab245e93324f/image/478fcfa676f260bc9a5628875ab7e0af.png?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&amp;max-w=3000&amp;max-h=3000&amp;fit=crop&amp;auto=format,compress&amp;w=400&amp;auto=format\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">47:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0811</span></div>\n<h2>別擋在孩子和屏幕之間，要站在孩子這邊</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">毒性應激的真實機制是被暴露時缺少成人緩衝；越能和孩子站同一邊、把技術當共同對手，關係就越能成為數字時代最強的保護。</p>\n<div class